  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Budget and Financial Accountability - Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Uzbekistan project will be both an intermittent and resident advisor project. The advisor will focus on: developing a strategic approach to fiscal policy, with a shift toward performance and results including the implementation of new fiscal forecasting tools, including: 1) strengthening the budget process, including effective systems and processes for submitting and defending the annual budget to Parliament 2) improving the transparency of the budget documentation 3) developing expenditure scrutiny functions for new spending,4) shifting budget policy towards performance and results. The project will also focus on improving the treasury execution process of the State Budget through improving liquidity and cash management, including a review of current business processes and ensuring comprehensive coverage of the Treasury Single Account (TSA) including foreign currency accounts.. .</narrative>
  </description>
